      "writtenOn": "2021-01-20T01:54:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I should have been more specific. Please provide a comment in the code that explains why this is here, what it\u0027s used for etc. :-) It\u0027ll be hard to figure it out otherwise. That said...\n\nWhen the device is \"idle\" if the modem crashes, I don\u0027t think we should necessarily set any thresholds since the filter bit for SignalStrength should be \"true\" (as in, when the device is idle, no signal strength info should be reported).\n\nWhat am I missing?",
      "parentUuid": "0c3fa5e4_d657218f",
