      "writtenOn": "2021-01-20T00:33:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, we do have some room to better maintain the record list. But this should not be a blocker for IC.\n\nCurrent behavior is the \"dangling\" requests will be cleared up when the app process die. As we always check the subId in the record with current subId, it will cause us much trouble.",
